{
 "about": "Vectors for the x402/exact/hedera/transfer-executor pairing, from x402's own example at 8228bd6d. idDigest is the payer's, printf '%s' '0.0.5001' | sha256sum; openssl dgst -sha256 and Python hashlib printed the same. Payee and amount are not read: a row settles when the payer is the one account debited. The staking-reward rows add a reward of 12345 tinybars to x402's example as HIP-406 records one: the rewarded account's credit in transfers includes the reward, 0.0.800 pays it, and staking_reward_transfers lists it. Each parent entry with transfers carries charged_tx_fee, the fee the Mirror Node's Transaction records as charged to the fee payer; here it is the fee payer's 5000000-tinybar debit, credited to 0.0.3 and 0.0.98; x402's example states no fee. A row's reference fields override the status reference.",
